      "text": "Yep, and -Confirm:$false says \"I don't want to confirm at all\"\n\nThe crazy part is -WhatIf is basically saying:\n\n\"Anytime I .ShouldProcess\", return $false and write whatever was asked to the terminal.\n\n🤔 wished it returned objs for years, then figured out:\n\nif ($WhatIfPreference) { return $obj }"
